          "code": "X",
          "symbol": "X_i",
          "meaning": "顺序统计量期望数组"
        }
      ],
      "basis": "方法构造：White reduced Log-Weibull顺序统计量期望，不以中位秩近似替代。",
      "notes": "",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "python/methods/lse.py",
          "symbol": "_log_weibull_order_stat_mean",
          "label": "数值积分"
        },
